{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52737","headline":"丹元子步天歌 西方七宿 五 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 西方七宿 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"毕，恰似爪叉八星出。\n附耳毕股一星光，天街两星毕背傍。\n天节耳下八乌幢，毕下横列六诸王。\n王下四皂天高星，节下团圆九州城。\n毕口斜对五车口，车有三柱任纵横。\n车中五个天潢精，潢畔咸池三黑星。\n天关一星车脚边，参旗九个参车间，旗下直建九斿连，斿下十三乌天园，九斿天园参脚边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52737.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52737","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}